1
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:05,900
I can't believe my little brother's married!
天啊，不敢相信我小弟結婚了

2
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:11,260
Why didn't you tell me you were eloping?
你們決定私訂終身 怎麼沒跟我說？

3
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:14,200
Well,we were at court, eating lunch
一切都發生得很自然 我們在法院吃中飯

4
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:16,070
Why were you at the courthouse?
等等，你們幹嘛去法院？

5
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,840
We were having lunch.
吃中飯啊

6
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:20,780
We were like...
那時的感覺就像是…

7
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:25,210
...we're here,we're having lunch. Let's get married! Right?
既然都來法院吃中飯了 不如就順便結婚吧

8
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:29,750
A year ago,I didn't know I had a brother. Now I have a sister!
一年前我還不知道自己有弟弟 現在又多了個妹妹

9
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,860
Oh,it's so great.
真是太棒了

10
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:39,520
Okay.
好了

11
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,690
Okay.
夠了

12
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:43,300
Stop it! Don't!
別再親了

13
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:46,930
I'll get you a gift now.
我得送你們新婚禮物才行

14
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:49,200
Is there anything you need?
你們有需要什麼嗎？

15
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:57,710
We've been trying to get pregnant since we got engaged,to get a jump on things.
我們訂婚後就一直想懷孕 心想越早生越好

16
00:00:58,650 --> 00:01:00,710
No one's getting any younger.
總是年輕不再了嘛

17
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:06,720
Because the thing is,we're not able to,you know,conceive.
不過重點是我們沒辦法… 成功做人

18
00:01:06,930 --> 00:01:09,160
We've seen a bunch of doctors.
我們試過所有方法 看了一堆醫生

19
00:01:09,430 --> 00:01:12,490
They say that our only chance to have a baby...
對，他們說我們若想生小孩

20
00:01:12,730 --> 00:01:17,830
...is that if they take my sperm, her egg,put it together in a dish...
唯有把我的精子和她的卵子 放進培養皿裡頭

21
00:01:18,110 --> 00:01:20,070
...and put it into another girl.
再放進另一個女孩的子宮裡

22
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:24,010
We were wondering if you could be that girl.
不知道你願不願意 讓我們把受精卵放進去？

23
00:01:28,420 --> 00:01:30,980
That's a really nice gift.
這真是個很棒的禮物

24
00:01:32,590 --> 00:01:34,490
I was thinking of a gravy boat.
我還以為 你們會想要個是醬料皿呢

25
00:01:36,190 --> 00:01:38,920
We know it's a lot to ask.
我們知道這個要求很過份

26
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:42,150
We don't have anyone else to go to. We could pay someone...
但我們求助無門 本想找別人做代理孕母 

27
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:44,090
...but we don't have that kind of money.
但我們沒那筆錢

28
00:01:44,230 --> 00:01:47,000
Plus,you know,you're family and,you know...
再加上你又是家人

29
00:01:47,140 --> 00:01:52,470
...I just don't want my baby to grow into some chick I don't know,you know?
我也不想把孩子 放進不認識的女孩肚子裡

30
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:55,610
Don't give us an answer yet, think about it.
不急著回答，你考慮看看

31
00:01:55,740 --> 00:02:01,080
And if you say no, we'll totally understand.
若你拒絕，我們也能完全瞭解

32
00:02:01,420 --> 00:02:05,050
Okay. Okay.
好吧…

33
00:02:05,790 --> 00:02:11,190
And we were wondering if you could give us a ride down to the train station.
對，能不能載我們去火車站？

34
00:02:13,290 --> 00:02:17,290
Well,actually,we kind of need an answer to that one right now.
這問題可能要馬上回答才行

35
00:02:18,530 --> 00:02:20,360
The One with Phoebe's Uterus
菲比的子宮

00:02:19,530 --> 00:02:20,360
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

36
00:03:06,310 --> 00:03:09,580
Check it out! Guess what job I just got.
大伙照過來 猜我得到了什麼工作？

37
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:16,320
I don't know,but Donald Trump wants his blue blazer black.
不知道，但是唐納川普 想把他的藍色外套黑回去

38
00:03:17,590 --> 00:03:18,580
What?
什麼？

39
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:22,530
Blue blazer back. He wants it back.
把藍色外套要回去，是要回去

40
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:27,360
You said "black." Why would he want his blue blazer black?
你剛才是說「黑」 他把藍外套黑回去幹嘛？

41
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:30,870
Well,you know what I meant.
你知道我的意思

42
00:03:31,210 --> 00:03:32,540
You messed it up.
是你說錯了

43
00:03:34,140 --> 00:03:36,010
You're stupid.
你真蠢

44
00:03:38,850 --> 00:03:40,610
So,what job did you get?
喬伊，你是得到什麼工作？

45
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:43,880
Tour guide at the museum. Ross got it for me.
在博物館當導覽員 羅斯幫我爭取到的

46
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:47,320
Don't you have to be a dinosaur expert?
在博物館當導覽員 不是得要恐龍專家才行？

47
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,850
They give you all the information.
不盡然，他們會把資料都給你

48
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:52,490
It's like memorizing a script.
就跟背劇本一樣

49
00:03:52,690 --> 00:03:57,100
On your left you have a tyrannosaurus rex, from the Jurassic Period.
左方是侏羅紀的暴龍

50
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,060
Very nice.
不賴嘛

51
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:02,860
Yeah,actually,Joey, it's the Cretaceous Period.
其實暴龍是白堊紀的恐龍

52
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:06,800
But I can pronounce Jurassic.
是，但我念得出侏羅紀

53
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:11,880
Frank Jr. and Alice got married!
你們猜怎麼著？ 法蘭克和艾莉絲結婚了

54
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:13,910
Oh,my God!
天啊

55
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:15,580
They're having a baby!
而且他們就要生小孩了

56
00:04:17,550 --> 00:04:20,750
They want me to grow it for them in my uterus!
而且他們還要用我的子宮來生

57
00:04:24,490 --> 00:04:26,550
-My God! -Are you serious?
天啊 你是認真的嗎？

58
00:04:27,930 --> 00:04:31,390
You're thinking of having sex with your brother?
你在考慮和自己的弟弟上床？

60
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:37,030
Ew! And,oh,no!
噁心喔，才不是

61
00:04:37,440 --> 00:04:39,570
They want me to be the surrogate.
他們只是要找我當代理孕母

62
00:04:39,770 --> 00:04:43,870
It's her egg and his sperm. I'm the oven. It's their bun.
用他們的精子和卵子 我只負責當爐子烤麵包

63
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:46,880
What did you say?
那你答應了沒？

64
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:51,040
I had to think about it first, but what is there to think of?
他們說要先讓我考慮一下 但是有啥好考慮的？

65
00:04:51,250 --> 00:04:54,590
I'll be giving someone the greatest gift.
這是我能送出最重的厚禮

66
00:04:54,860 --> 00:04:59,020
You'll carry their child and get them a Sony PlayStation?
你幫他們生小孩 還加贈新力PS遊戲機？

67
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:03,030
This is an incredible thing to do.
這對他們一定是意義重大

68
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:05,930
But there are things to think about.
但是你得考慮到一些事

69
00:05:06,170 --> 00:05:09,500
Yeah,you'd be pregnant. I mean,pregnant.
對啊，你會懷孕，懷孕耶

70
00:05:10,100 --> 00:05:11,700
I know.
我知道啊

71
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:15,870
You'll put your body through an awful lot.
這對身體可是沉重負擔

72
00:05:16,110 --> 00:05:19,380
I mean,morning sickness,labor.
會害喜，還有分娩

73
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,240
It's all for somebody else.
還全都是為了別人

74
00:05:21,450 --> 00:05:23,310
Yeah. What's your point?
是啊，你的重點是什麼？

75
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:26,950
Well,the stuff I just mentioned.
我剛才說的就是啊

76
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,450
I couldn't do that.
這種事我一定做不到

77
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:34,460
I always figured the first time I had a baby, it'd be with someone I love.
我心想自己第一次懷孕 一定會是跟心愛的人

78
00:05:34,660 --> 00:05:36,360
And that baby was,you know...
孩子出生之後…

79
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:38,120
...a keeper.
一定要留在自己身邊

80
00:05:38,900 --> 00:05:43,360
You were more supportive when I wanted to make denim furniture.
我當時要用牛仔布做傢俱時 你們都還比較支持

81
00:05:43,570 --> 00:05:47,410
If you decide to do this, we'll be supportive like crazy.
如果你決定要這麼做 我們一定支持得五體投地

82
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:49,080
Just think it through.
我們只是要你考慮清楚

83
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:52,470
Talk to somebody who's had a baby. Like your mom.
或許和生過小孩的人討論一下 好比你母親

84
00:05:52,710 --> 00:05:57,580
My mom never gave birth. Oh! But my birth mom did!
我媽才沒生過小孩呢 不過我的生母有

85
00:05:59,659 --> 00:06:01,456
（中央咖啡館）

86
00:06:03,930 --> 00:06:07,920
I love this tushy! Can I take it to work with me?
我喜歡你的小屁屁 可以讓我帶去上班嗎？

87
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:12,320
Yeah,sure. It's not mine anyway. It came with the pants.
沒問題，反正不是我的 是買褲子附贈的

88
00:06:17,510 --> 00:06:18,940
I am so jealous.
我嫉妒死了

89
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:21,700
You guys are just right there.
你們倆真的好投入

90
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:23,740
Yes.
是啊

91
00:06:24,380 --> 00:06:25,510
Right where?
投入什麼？

92
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:30,580
The beginning,where it's all sex and talking...
剛開始的熱戀啊 上床、聊天…

93
00:06:30,850 --> 00:06:33,410
...and sex and talking.
再上床、再聊天

94
00:06:33,590 --> 00:06:35,750
You got to love the talking.
聊天的部分很棒

95
00:06:37,430 --> 00:06:39,860
-And the sex? -We haven't had sex.
那上床呢？

96
00:06:38,531 --> 00:06:40,260
我們還沒上過床

97
00:06:41,060 --> 00:06:43,360
What's the big deal? This is special.
有啥好大驚小怪的？ 這樣才特別啊

98
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:47,360
I want our love to grow before moving to the next level.
在進入下一個階段前 我要讓愛情先滋長

99
00:06:47,870 --> 00:06:50,030
Oh,Chandler,that is so nice.
錢德，這真的太棒了

100
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:52,040
That is really nice...
真的是很棒

101
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,710
...Iying!
騙人！

102
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:57,870
-No way is that the reason. -Why?
不可能會是那個原因 為什麼？

103
00:06:58,080 --> 00:07:01,070
Because you're not mature enough to understand that?
因為你太幼稚 無法瞭解那種事？

104
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,380
He's right. I'm totally lying.
不，羅斯說的對，我是在騙人

105
00:07:08,460 --> 00:07:09,680
Then what is it?
那真相是什麼？

106
00:07:09,890 --> 00:07:11,950
Kathy's last boyfriend was Joey.
因為凱茜前任男友是喬伊

107
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:17,520
And you're afraid you won't be able to fill his shoes?
你擔心自己…技不如人？

108
00:07:19,570 --> 00:07:22,760
I'm afraid I won't make love as well as him.
不 我擔心自己床上功夫沒他行

109
00:07:23,570 --> 00:07:27,600
-I was going for the metaphor. -I was saying the actual words.
我是想要用比喻的 我是直接說出來

111
00:07:29,380 --> 00:07:32,780
He's had a lot of girlfriends. Doesn't mean he's great in bed.
沒事啦，喬伊交過一卡車女友 這也不表示他床功一流

112
00:07:33,380 --> 00:07:34,810
We share a wall.
我和他的臥房只隔了一道牆

113
00:07:37,550 --> 00:07:41,420
Either he's great,or she liked to agree with him a lot.
若非他真的很強 就是他女友喜歡附和他

114
00:07:44,430 --> 00:07:46,830
Loudly and a lot.
動不動就大聲附和

115
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:49,930
All night long she'd agree.
從半夜附和到天亮

116
00:07:50,670 --> 00:07:55,330
It'll be different. The sex will be great because you're in love.
你們的情況不一樣 有愛做基礎的性會更棒

117
00:07:58,110 --> 00:08:00,670
-Just go for it. -Yeah,you should.
是嗎？ 是啊 錢德，放手一試吧

119
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:03,840
All right. I'll sleep with my girlfriend.
好吧，我去跟女友一起睡

121
00:08:05,050 --> 00:08:07,380
But I'm just doing it for you guys.
但我這全是為了你們

122
00:08:10,490 --> 00:08:15,250
Now,the mastodon is from the semi-late Jurassic Period.
乳齒象來自侏羅紀半晚期

123
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:19,250
Isn't the mastodon from the Pliocene Epoch?
乳齒象不是上新世的嗎？

124
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:23,360
This is a museum. No talking.
這裡是博物館，不能說話

125
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:26,890
Right down here we have...
這裡的就是…

126
00:08:27,670 --> 00:08:29,160
...a large foot.
大腳

127
00:08:32,610 --> 00:08:35,670
And over here we have Ross Geller.
這位是羅斯蓋勒

128
00:08:35,980 --> 00:08:38,000
Everyone wave "hi" to Ross.
大家揮手和羅斯打招呼

129
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:41,440
Ross is one of our scientists. Look at him hard at work.
羅斯是館內頭號重要的科學家 你們看他工作有多努力

130
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:48,480
Okay,moving right along.
好，繼續參觀

131
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,050
Come on.
走吧

132
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:55,690
It's open. Come in.
門沒關，請進

133
00:08:56,830 --> 00:08:58,820
-I'm sorry I'm late. -That's okay.
抱歉遲到了 沒關係

134
00:08:59,130 --> 00:09:01,620
I had time to finish glazing my nipples.
我正好有時間替乳頭上釉

135
00:09:02,870 --> 00:09:05,900
You go all out when you're expecting company.
你為了見客還真是拚命

136
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:09,600
I was working on my pottery.
我說的是陶器

137
00:09:11,010 --> 00:09:14,850
Oh! I didn't know that you did pot.
我不知道你會做…鍋子

138
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:21,150
Mostly nudes. It combines my two passions: pottery and erotica.
對，大多沒穿衣服 結合陶藝和色情這兩種愛好

139
00:09:21,890 --> 00:09:24,290
Erottery!
就叫做「陶情」吧

140
00:09:25,690 --> 00:09:27,660
Thanks for coming out to see me.
謝謝你來看我

141
00:09:27,930 --> 00:09:32,890
I thought it'd be a good idea to talk about this baby stuff in person.
我只是覺得生小孩這件事 還是當面聊比較好

142
00:09:34,340 --> 00:09:36,360
I don't think it's a good idea.
菲比，我覺得這樣不妥

143
00:09:37,710 --> 00:09:39,070
Why not?
為什麼？

144
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:41,570
You'd be giving up a baby.
因為你最後得要送走孩子

145
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,570
And I really don't
我不知道…

146
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,840
I don't know if anything I said...
不知道要怎麼說...

147
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:49,950
...would make you understand the pain of giving up a baby.
...你才會懂 送走孩子會有多麼痛苦

148
00:09:50,022 --> 00:09:51,922
所以…

149
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:58,690
No,no,I understand the pain. Don't hurt the puppy!
不…我瞭解那種痛苦 不要傷害小狗

150
00:09:59,330 --> 00:10:01,090
No,no. The puppy is yours.
不是啦…這小狗是你的了

151
00:10:01,530 --> 00:10:05,560
-I get a puppy? -But for only three days.
我有小狗？ 對，但只能擁有三天

153
00:10:05,970 --> 00:10:07,200
Why?
為什麼？

154
00:10:09,570 --> 00:10:14,700
I realize I don't have any right to start getting parent-y on you now.
我知道我現在沒有權力 突然搬出媽媽的臉孔跟你說教

155
00:10:20,850 --> 00:10:24,150
Look at me and not the puppy. It's very important.
菲比，麻煩別看小狗 看著我，我要說重要的事

156
00:10:25,550 --> 00:10:27,320
I know what I'm talking about.
我知道我在說什麼

158
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:30,380
I gave up two babies.
我送走過兩個孩子

159
00:10:30,660 --> 00:10:35,390
I only wish I had someone who'd given up babies that told me...
只希望當時能有前輩告訴我

160
00:10:35,660 --> 00:10:37,530
...how terrible it is.
送走自己的小孩會有多痛苦

161
00:10:40,370 --> 00:10:43,670
I really shouldn't have given you the puppy first.
早知道就別先把小狗給你

162
00:10:45,470 --> 00:10:48,030
That's okay. No,we're listening.
沒關係，我專心聽你說

163
00:10:48,510 --> 00:10:53,040
It'd be something you'd regret every day for the rest of your life.
我只是覺得送走孩子後 你會每天後悔直到死掉

164
00:10:55,980 --> 00:10:59,510
So however hard it is for you to give up this puppy...
你到時送走這條小狗的痛苦

165
00:11:00,020 --> 00:11:04,190
...it'd be a million times harder to give up a child.
還不及送走孩子的百萬分之一

166
00:11:04,930 --> 00:11:08,830
Okay,fair enough. Three days.
好，很合理，就養三天

167
00:11:10,630 --> 00:11:14,330
Oh,it's time to take my ass out of the kiln.
該把屁股拿出烤窯了

168
00:11:19,540 --> 00:11:23,140
Could you sit there? I'm saving this seat for my friend Ross.
你能不能坐對面？ 我幫朋友羅斯留了位置

169
00:11:23,310 --> 00:11:24,640
You mean Dr. Geller?
你是說蓋勒博士？

170
00:11:24,980 --> 00:11:28,040
Doctor? I didn't know he had a nickname.
博士？我不知道他有這綽號

171
00:11:29,380 --> 00:11:31,150
Oh,he won't sit here.
他才不會坐這裡呢

172
00:11:31,450 --> 00:11:33,510
Only people in white coats sit there.
穿白袍的都會坐在那裡

173
00:11:33,820 --> 00:11:36,690
Only people in blue blazers sit here.
穿藍色外套的只能坐這裡

174
00:11:37,530 --> 00:11:40,090
-How come? -That's just the way it is.
為什麼這樣？ 就是這樣

176
00:11:40,860 --> 00:11:42,160
That's crazy.
豈有此理

177
00:11:42,460 --> 00:11:47,700
Maybe it's crazy in a perfect world: a world without lab coats and blazers.
或許在不分藍白的完美世界裡 這樣就會是豈有此理

178
00:11:47,970 --> 00:11:51,270
But you not in a perfect world. You in a museum now.
但你不是活在完美世界 而且這裡是博物館

179
00:11:53,710 --> 00:11:55,070
See that scientist?
看到那戴眼鏡的科學家沒？

180
00:11:55,710 --> 00:12:00,240
He and I used to play together in grade school,but now....
想當年我們念小學還是玩伴 但現在呢？

181
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:03,740
Peter! Hey,Peter!
彼德！…

182
00:12:04,550 --> 00:12:07,990
It's me! Rhonda,from P.S. 129?
我是朗妲，我們是同屆的啊

183
00:12:08,820 --> 00:12:11,450
I shared my pudding with you,man!
虧我把布丁分你吃過

184
00:12:12,890 --> 00:12:15,660
I gave you my Snack Pack!
我還把點心棒送給你吃

185
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:20,830
See? He pretend he don't even hear me!
看到沒？他假裝通通沒聽到

186
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:24,930
Everyone's pretending they don't hear you.
我想大家都在假裝沒聽到

187
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:30,310
I don't know about your jackets and separate tables...
我是不知道什麼制服 還有你們分桌吃飯的事啦

188
00:12:30,510 --> 00:12:32,000
...but Ross is my friend.
不過羅斯是我的死黨

189
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:36,440
And if I save him a seat, he will sit in it.
若我幫他留了位置 我告訴你，他一定會坐

190
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:40,780
Here! I saved you a seat!
羅斯…來這裡坐 我幫你留了位置

191
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:47,490
I'm cool here. I'll catch up with you later.
我坐這裡就好了 之後再去找你聊

192
00:12:52,170 --> 00:12:53,530
This is saved.
這個位置有人坐了

193
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,930
Gift shop.
她是禮品店的

194
00:13:06,450 --> 00:13:10,610
I'm really,really sorry about what happened in the cafeteria today.
今天在自助餐廳的事很抱歉

195
00:13:11,950 --> 00:13:14,110
You do what you got to do.
沒什麼，該怎麼做就怎麼做

196
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:18,690
The scientists and the tour guides never sit together.
不只是我而已 科學家和導覽員從來不坐一起

197
00:13:20,590 --> 00:13:21,580
Whatever.
隨便啦

198
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:24,600
It's like that everywhere. Mon,back me up.
這種情況到處都有 摩妮卡，幫我說說話啊

199
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:27,960
Where you work,the waiters eat with the waiters.
在你工作的地方 侍者和侍者一起吃飯

200
00:13:28,170 --> 00:13:30,690
And the chefs eat with the other chefs?
廚師和廚師吃飯，對吧？

201
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:35,340
I eat by myself in the alley, because everybody hates me.
我是自己躲在巷子裡吃 因為大家都恨我

202
00:13:36,610 --> 00:13:40,600
Okay,Rach,when was the last time you had lunch with the shipping clerks?
好，瑞秋，你上回 和運貨員一起吃飯是何時？

203
00:13:40,780 --> 00:13:43,270
I've never had lunch with the shipping clerks...
你聽我說，我不常跟他們吃飯 

204
00:13:43,420 --> 00:13:48,050
...but it's totally different. They're not allowed in the executive cafeteria.
但這完全是兩碼子事 因他們不能進主管的自助餐廳

206
00:13:48,190 --> 00:13:50,820
Oh,I see what you're saying.
我懂你的意思了

207
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,890
Look,Ross.
羅斯，你聽我說

208
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:55,690
It's no big deal.
這沒啥大不了的啦

209
00:13:55,830 --> 00:13:58,200
You wear a white coat. I wear a blue blazer.
你穿白袍，我穿藍色外套

210
00:13:58,400 --> 00:14:01,890
If that means we can't be friends at work,so be it.
若這表示我們上班不能當朋友 那就這樣吧

211
00:14:02,100 --> 00:14:03,900
I understand,you know?
我能瞭解

212
00:14:04,270 --> 00:14:08,970
When I'm in a play and you're in the audience,I don't talk to you.
我演舞台劇，你坐觀眾席 我也不會跟你說話，是吧？

213
00:14:09,910 --> 00:14:12,240
So it's,you know,it's cool.
所以沒事了

214
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:13,950
I'll see you tomorrow.
明天見

215
00:14:17,150 --> 00:14:21,020
When we're in the audience, he doesn't talk but he does wave.
我們坐在觀眾席 他是沒說話，但有跟我們招手

216
00:14:25,490 --> 00:14:31,190
Who's my puppy? Who's my puppy? Who's my puppy?
我的小狗好不好呀？…

217
00:14:31,330 --> 00:14:35,390
-Have you named him yet? -No,I don't want to get attached.
你幫它取名字沒？ 沒有，我不想陷下去

219
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:38,600
-Can I hold him? -Sure. Here.
可以讓我抱抱嗎？ 當然可以

220
00:14:38,770 --> 00:14:42,470
-Come here,squirmy. Hello -Not like that. No.
來，給我抱抱 不是那樣抱啦

222
00:14:51,290 --> 00:14:53,780
Why's Phoebe singing to Karl Malden?
菲比幹嘛唱歌給卡爾馬登聽？

223
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:58,620
I think it's time for puppy to go out again.
小狗又應該出去了

224
00:14:58,930 --> 00:15:01,090
Come on,let's go to the balcony.
走，我們去陽台

225
00:15:01,300 --> 00:15:04,750
The street. Come on,let's go to the street.
什麼？ 去街上，走，我們去街上

226
00:15:04,970 --> 00:15:08,400
Don't go on the balcony until after I get back.
在我回來之前，別去陽台

227
00:15:10,770 --> 00:15:12,360
So did you do it?
你們做了沒？

228
00:15:12,740 --> 00:15:15,070
Yes,yes,we had the sex.
有…我們上床了

229
00:15:15,780 --> 00:15:17,300
It was bad?
糟糕，不好喔？

230
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:22,450
It was fine,but she didn't agree with me as strongly as with Joey.
好是好，但是她附和我的程度 不像附和喬伊那樣強烈

231
00:15:24,790 --> 00:15:27,950
She was like,"l see your point. I'm all right with it."
感覺像是「我瞭解，無所謂」

232
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:33,420
There's not always a lot of agreement the first time.
第一次的互動總是比較生疏

233
00:15:33,730 --> 00:15:37,560
Yeah. Not for girls,anyway. Guys agree like that.
對，女生要慢慢來 不像男生一碰就互動了

234
00:15:38,470 --> 00:15:40,590
Look,you have to help me.
你們得幫幫我

235
00:15:40,830 --> 00:15:41,990
I mean....
我是說…

236
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:46,730
I know what to do with a woman. It's always nice.
我知道怎麼在床上取悅女人 我知道步驟，一直也都很好

237
00:15:47,010 --> 00:15:48,270
I need to know...
但我需要知道…

238
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:50,470
...what makes it go from nice to:
要怎麼從「好」進階到…

239
00:15:50,740 --> 00:15:53,580
"My God! Somebody's killing her in there!"
「老天 那傢伙讓她欲仙欲死」

240
00:15:54,520 --> 00:15:57,750
I'll show you something a lot of guys don't know.
我來開釋一個 很多男人不知道的事

241
00:15:56,822 --> 00:15:58,312
瑞秋，麻煩把那本子給我

242
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:00,750
All right.
好吧

243
00:16:00,990 --> 00:16:02,250
Now.
來羅

244
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:06,320
You don't have to draw an actual Whoa,she's hot!
你不用真的畫出… 哇，她身材真惹火

245
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:10,130
Everyone knows the erogenous zones.
大家都知道性感帶在哪裡

246
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,850
You got one,two,three...
有一、二、三…

247
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:13,930
...four...
四…

248
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:17,300
...five,six and seven.
五、六，還有七

249
00:16:17,770 --> 00:16:19,260
There are seven?
性感帶有七個？

250
00:16:20,170 --> 00:16:21,770
Let me see that.
我看看

251
00:16:22,310 --> 00:16:24,470
Oh,yeah.
對，沒錯

252
00:16:26,150 --> 00:16:27,670
That's one?
那裡也算一個？

253
00:16:27,950 --> 00:16:29,710
Kind of an important one.
還蠻重要的呢

254
00:16:30,780 --> 00:16:32,780
I was looking at it upside down.
反過來看會有誤差嘛

255
00:16:35,790 --> 00:16:38,220
Well,you know,sometimes that helps.
有時候反過來也不錯

256
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:48,200
Most guys will hit one,two,three and then go to seven and set up camp.
男人大多數愛撫過一、二、三 就直接跳到第七個，結束比賽

257
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:51,560
That's bad?
那樣不好嗎？

258
00:16:51,870 --> 00:16:55,810
At Disneyland,you don't spend the whole day on the Matterhorn.
你去迪士尼樂園 也不會整天只玩馬特洪雪橇啊

259
00:16:56,210 --> 00:16:58,470
You might if it were like seven.
若那是第七個就有可能

260
00:17:00,150 --> 00:17:04,550
All right,the important thing is to take your time.
重點是慢慢來

261
00:17:04,820 --> 00:17:06,480
You want to hit them all...
七個性感帶都要照顧到

262
00:17:06,690 --> 00:17:09,020
...mix them up. Keep them on their toes.
還要搭配混和使用 就像踮腳那樣維持緊繃

263
00:17:09,220 --> 00:17:11,490
Oh,toes!
腳趾！

264
00:17:16,700 --> 00:17:18,260
For some people.
有些人的腳趾會興奮嘛

265
00:17:19,070 --> 00:17:20,560
All right.
好吧

266
00:17:20,770 --> 00:17:24,230
You could start out with a little one.
你可以先小小來個一

267
00:17:24,510 --> 00:17:25,770
A two.
再來二

268
00:17:26,040 --> 00:17:27,340
A one,two,three.
一、二、三搭配

269
00:17:28,180 --> 00:17:29,200
A three.
一個三

270
00:17:30,410 --> 00:17:31,710
A five.
一個五

271
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,670
A four.
一個四

272
00:17:34,210 --> 00:17:35,580
A three,two.
來個三和二

273
00:17:35,850 --> 00:17:37,840
Two. A two,four,six.
二，再配個二、四、六

274
00:17:38,850 --> 00:17:40,550
Two,four,six.
二、四、六

275
00:17:40,750 --> 00:17:42,420
Four. Two.
四、二

276
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:46,390
Two. Four,seven!
二，四和七

277
00:17:46,530 --> 00:17:49,020
Five,seven! Six,seven!
五配七，六配七

278
00:17:49,260 --> 00:17:51,630
Seven! Seven!
七！…

279
00:17:51,900 --> 00:17:55,360
Seven! Seven! Seven! Seven! Seven! Seven!

280
00:17:55,500 --> 00:17:57,400
Seven!

281
00:18:03,780 --> 00:18:05,840
And there you are.
這樣就可以了

282
00:18:06,650 --> 00:18:09,050
Yeah,that'll work.
對，那樣會有效的

283
00:18:26,170 --> 00:18:28,460
Dr. Geller? There's a seat here.
蓋勒博士，這裡有位置

284
00:18:29,340 --> 00:18:31,900
Thank you,Dr. Phillips.
菲利普斯博士，謝謝你

285
00:18:32,170 --> 00:18:33,700
But I'm having my lunch...
但我的午餐…

286
00:18:34,010 --> 00:18:37,170
...at this table. Here in the middle.
要在這張桌子上吃 中間這一張

287
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:39,340
I'm having my lunch...
我的午餐…

288
00:18:39,510 --> 00:18:43,380
...right here with my good friend,Joey.
就在這裡和好友喬伊一起吃

289
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:45,550
If he'll sit with me.
若他願意跟我坐一起的話

290
00:18:51,230 --> 00:18:53,190
I will sit with you,Dr. Geller.
蓋勒博士，我跟你坐

291
00:18:58,330 --> 00:18:59,420
You know...
你們知道嗎…

292
00:18:59,700 --> 00:19:03,140
...we work in a museum of natural history.
我們在自然史博物館工作

293
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:05,930
And yet,there is something...
然而卻有一件事…

294
00:19:06,140 --> 00:19:07,660
...unnatural...
很不自然

295
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:10,610
...about the way we eat lunch.
我們吃中飯的方式很不自然

296
00:19:12,410 --> 00:19:14,180
Now,I want you to know...
我要讓你們知道 

297
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:19,410
...it took a tour guide to show this scientist the error of his ways.
這位導覽員讓我這科學家 瞭解到自己處事方法的錯誤

299
00:19:19,690 --> 00:19:23,420
You might even say he took me on a tour...
甚至可以說他帶領我 看到了...

300
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:26,020
...of myself.
...我自己的內心

301
00:19:27,390 --> 00:19:30,020
Yeah,that was me.
對，他說的就是我

302
00:19:30,660 --> 00:19:34,900
I look around,and you know what I see? I see division.
我環顧這自助餐聽的四周 看到了什麼？我看到隔閡

303
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:40,100
Division between people in white coats and people in blue blazers.   
穿白袍的人和穿藍外套的人 彼此有著隔閡

304
00:19:40,370 --> 00:19:42,570
I ask myself,"My God,why?"
我捫心自問 「天啊，這是為什麼？」

305
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:47,850
Now,I say we shed these coats...
我建議大家脫掉…

306
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,740
...that separate us.
造成我們隔閡的這些外套

307
00:19:50,780 --> 00:19:53,950
And we get to know the people underneath.
才能認識衣服裡面的人

308
00:19:57,190 --> 00:19:58,250
I'm Ross!
我是羅斯！

309
00:19:58,930 --> 00:20:01,790
I'm divorced and I have a kid!
我離過婚，有個小孩

310
00:20:07,970 --> 00:20:10,370
I'm Joey! I'm an actor!
我是喬伊，我是個演員

311
00:20:11,100 --> 00:20:13,870
I don't know squat about dinosaurs!
我對恐龍一竅不通

312
00:20:16,410 --> 00:20:21,540
I'm Ted,and I just moved here, and New York really scares me.
我是泰德，一個月前才搬來 紐約真是嚇壞我了

313
00:20:21,750 --> 00:20:24,720
-There you go! -Hang in there,Teddy!
這就對了！ 泰德，你要撐住

314
00:20:25,990 --> 00:20:27,420
I'm Andrew.
我是安德魯

315
00:20:27,990 --> 00:20:30,390
And I didn't pay for this pear.
這顆西洋梨我沒付錢

316
00:20:32,530 --> 00:20:34,320
Okay. Good for you.
好，有你的

317
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:39,390
I'm Rhonda! And these aren't real!
我是朗妲，這一對不是真的！

318
00:20:43,770 --> 00:20:45,530
Wow,Rhonda.
朗妲…

319
00:20:47,570 --> 00:20:50,240
-I'm Scott. -Yeah,okay,Scott!
我是史考特 幫史考特加油

320
00:20:51,010 --> 00:20:54,740
I flip the light switch on and off 17 times when I leave a room...
我在離開一個房間之前 一定要連續開燈關燈17次

321
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:57,180
...or my family will die.
不然我全家都會死光光

322
00:21:01,420 --> 00:21:03,050
My mom's gonna be here any minute.
我媽隨時會來

323
00:21:03,290 --> 00:21:05,620
I can't. I can't give him up.
我沒辦法，我不能送走它

324
00:21:06,760 --> 00:21:08,460
Yes,no. I can.
不對，我可以

325
00:21:09,060 --> 00:21:10,290
I don't want to.
我不想

326
00:21:11,030 --> 00:21:12,400
But I can.
但是我可以

327
00:21:13,230 --> 00:21:14,860
No.
不行

328
00:21:15,100 --> 00:21:18,470
I can't watch this. It's like Sophie's Choice.
我再看下去一定會崩潰 這就像是「蘇菲的選擇」

329
00:21:19,770 --> 00:21:21,760
You know,I never saw that.
我從沒看過那部電影

330
00:21:21,980 --> 00:21:24,100
Oh,it was only okay.
其實很普通而已啦

331
00:21:25,450 --> 00:21:27,240
I can't do this.
我辦不到

332
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:31,610
My mom was right. If I can't give him up...
我媽媽說的對 若我連一條狗都捨不得

333
00:21:31,890 --> 00:21:34,120
...there's no way I can give up a baby.
怎麼可能送走自己生的小孩

334
00:21:35,220 --> 00:21:38,390
Frank and Alice are going to be so crushed.
法蘭克和艾莉絲一定會很受傷

335
00:21:38,590 --> 00:21:42,220
What else can I give them? A kidney!
我能給他什麼別的？腎臟？

336
00:21:46,430 --> 00:21:48,300
We were in the neighborhood.
我們正好在附近

337
00:21:48,600 --> 00:21:52,660
We want to let you know that there's still no pressure.
我們順路過來是要讓你知道 還是不要有壓力

338
00:21:54,140 --> 00:21:58,580
If there was something you wanted to say,we'll be right there.
但是如果你有事要跟我們說 我們就坐在那裡喝咖啡

339
00:22:00,810 --> 00:22:02,340
Who's this little guy?
這個小傢伙是誰？

341
00:22:05,820 --> 00:22:09,760
He's so cute! He reminds me of my old dog,Tumor.
真可愛 讓我想起我的老狗腫瘤

342
00:22:12,630 --> 00:22:16,260
You are so precious, I could take you home.
瞧你可愛的，真想帶你回家

343
00:22:16,860 --> 00:22:17,890
Why don't you?
有何不可呢？

344
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:20,960
-Are you serious? -Yeah.
你是說真的？ 是啊

345
00:22:21,640 --> 00:22:24,100
Thanks.
多謝了

347
00:22:26,170 --> 00:22:29,040
-What are you doing? -I'm okay with this.
你在幹嘛？ 這樣不會讓我難過

348
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:31,710
You know why? Because look at them.
你們知道原因嗎？看看他們

349
00:22:31,950 --> 00:22:33,710
Look how happy they are.
看他們高興成那樣

350
00:22:33,980 --> 00:22:36,880
And I made that,so you know....
這是我的功勞，所以…

351
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:43,350
It'll be a million times harder to give up a baby,but oh,my God!
我知道送走自己生出來的孩子 一定會難上百萬倍…

352
00:22:43,620 --> 00:22:46,350
It'll feel a million times better,right?
但到時的快樂 一定也會是百萬倍，對吧？

353
00:22:47,990 --> 00:22:50,720
I'll do this. I want to carry your baby.
決定了，我要懷你們的孩子

354
00:22:55,740 --> 00:22:57,400
Thank you so much!
真是太感謝了

355
00:22:57,970 --> 00:23:00,410
You don't know what this means to us.
這對我們意義非凡

356
00:23:02,210 --> 00:23:04,300
I think I'm going to cry!
天啊，我都快哭了

357
00:23:09,750 --> 00:23:11,680
It's going to be so great.
一定會很棒的

358
00:23:14,720 --> 00:23:17,420
-What's going on? -I gave them the puppy.
怎麼回事？ 我把小狗給了他們

359
00:23:17,690 --> 00:23:21,560
It made them so happy, I decided to carry their baby.
看他們高興成那樣 我決定幫他們懷小孩

360
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:24,100
-Phoebe -No,I know.
菲比… 你不用說，我知道

361
00:23:24,330 --> 00:23:25,990
We're different,though.
不過你我是完全不同的人

362
00:23:26,230 --> 00:23:28,500
This is a different situation.
而且情況也完全不同

363
00:23:28,740 --> 00:23:31,170
I am not going to regret this.
我知道我這樣做絕不會後悔

364
00:23:31,710 --> 00:23:34,230
I understand all that.
你說的我都瞭解

365
00:23:34,610 --> 00:23:38,200
It's just,that was my puppy.
只是…那小狗是我的耶

366
00:23:42,520 --> 00:23:44,250
Would you ever be a surrogate?
你願意幫別人當代理孕母嗎？

367
00:23:44,750 --> 00:23:46,050
Depends who asked.
要看是誰要我幫忙

368
00:23:46,750 --> 00:23:47,980
What if I asked?
如果是我要你幫忙呢？

369
00:23:48,560 --> 00:23:50,720
Oh,Mon,sure!
摩妮卡，那我當然願意啊

370
00:23:50,990 --> 00:23:53,260
-Really? -Yes.
真的？ 是啊

371
00:23:57,000 --> 00:23:58,900
You're not asking me,are you?
你不是真要我幫忙吧？ 

372
00:23:59,030 --> 00:24:01,520
-No. -Yes. Totally.
不是 我當然幫你，一定幫

373
00:24:05,710 --> 00:24:08,370
Thank you! Thank you!
謝謝你…

374
00:24:08,980 --> 00:24:12,000
Thank you! Yes,thank you!
謝謝你 太謝謝你了！

375
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


376
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

